        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Welcome to WCCKIT\n\nWCCKIT helps characterise radio-astronomy processing pipelines by combining local run artifacts with live Grafana views. Start with the Pipeline Overview, then open the AMD, Intel, or Profiles dashboard depending on the collector path used for the run.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Disabled: No data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Viewer Stack",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Viewer endpoints\n\n- Grafana: `http://localhost:3000`\n- InfluxDB: `http://localhost:8086`\n- Pyroscope: `http://localhost:4040`\n\nDevelopment login: `admin` / `wcckit`\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Disabled: No data"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
